o_Much" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="Why Do the Prices of Black Sesame Oil Vary So Much">Why Do the Prices of Black Sesame Oil Vary So Much</span>?</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_is_Black_Sesame_Oil_Made"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="How is Black Sesame Oil Made">How is Black Sesame Oil Made</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="The process of making black sesame oil is actually quite intricate">The process of making black sesame oil is actually quite intricate</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="Let&#8217;s take a look at the steps">Let&#8217;s take a look at the steps</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="Prepare ingredients">Prepare ingredients</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="Black sesame seeds">Black sesame seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="walnut oil">walnut oil</span> (opcional), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="oil press">oil press</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="Cleaning the sesame seeds">Cleaning the sesame seeds</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="Take an appropriate amount of black sesame seeds">Take an appropriate amount of black sesame seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="wash them with water">wash them with water</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="and drain the excess water">and drain the excess water</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="Roasting the sesame seeds">Roasting the sesame seeds</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="Pour the drained sesame seeds into a flat pan or clay pot">Pour the drained sesame seeds into a flat pan or clay pot</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="and roast them over low heat">and roast them over low heat</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="Stir constantly with a spatula to avoid burning">Stir constantly with a spatula to avoid burning</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="and roast until the sesame seeds crackle and can be easily crushed by hand">and roast until the sesame seeds crackle and can be easily crushed by hand</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="Extracting the oil">Extracting the oil</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="If using an oil press">If using an oil press</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="preheat it first">preheat it first</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="then pour the roasted sesame seeds into the feeding hopper while hot">then pour the roasted sesame seeds into the feeding hopper while hot</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="The black sesame oil will flow out from the press chamber and pass through a filter into a container">The black sesame oil will flow out from the press chamber and pass through a filter into a container</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="If using a food processor or blender">If using a food processor or blender</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="let the roasted sesame seeds cool">let the roasted sesame seeds cool</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="then add them to the machine">then add them to the machine</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="You can add a small amount of walnut oil for extra smoothness and blend thoroughly">You can add a small amount of walnut oil for extra smoothness and blend thoroughly</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="After blending">After blending</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="pour the extracted black sesame oil into a container">pour the extracted black sesame oil into a container</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="Letting the oil settle">Letting the oil settle</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="The freshly extracted black sesame oil may appear cloudy">The freshly extracted black sesame oil may appear cloudy</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="Let it sit for at least">Let it sit for at least</span> 8 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="hours">hours</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="or longer if possible">or longer if possible</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="to allow the oil to clarify">to allow the oil to clarify</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="Storing">Storing</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="After the oil has settled">After the oil has settled</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="pour it into a sealed oil bottle for storage">pour it into a sealed oil bottle for storage</span>.</li></ul><p><img src="/images/sesame-oil-21-300x245.jpg" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-461" alt="black sesame oil" width="451" height="368" title="O que é óleo de gergelim preto? Benefícios e como usar 4" /></p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Use_Black_Sesame_Oil"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="How to Use Black Sesame Oil">How to Use Black Sesame Oil</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="You may wonder whether black sesame oil is used the same way as other oils">You may wonder whether black sesame oil is used the same way as other oils</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="Due to its unique flavor">Due to its unique flavor</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame oil has many applications">black sesame oil has many applications</span>:</p><ul><li><strong>Culinária</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="It is most commonly used in cooking">It is most commonly used in cooking</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="such as stir-frying and pan-frying fish">such as stir-frying and pan-frying fish</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="to enhance the aroma and taste of the dish">to enhance the aroma and taste of the dish</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="Cold dishes">Cold dishes</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="It can be used for dressing cold dishes">It can be used for dressing cold dishes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="or mixing noodles">or mixing noodles</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="or rice to add a rich flavor">or rice to add a rich flavor</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="Soups">Soups</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="Adding a small amount to soups can make them more delicious">Adding a small amount to soups can make them more delicious</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="Dipping sauce">Dipping sauce</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="It can be used as a dipping sauce to accompany various foods">It can be used as a dipping sauce to accompany various foods</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="Bread and buns">Bread and buns</span></str