 circulation and relaxation</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="Hair Care">Hair Care</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="Applying it to the hair or adding it to shampoo helps nourish and protect the hair">Applying it to the hair or adding it to shampoo helps nourish and protect the hair</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="making it healthier and shinier">making it healthier and shinier</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="Dietary Supplement">Dietary Supplement</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="Nutrient-rich">Nutrient-rich</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="containing protein">containing protein</span>, gordo, vitaminas, e minerais, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="moderate consumption can nourish the body and boost immunity">moderate consumption can nourish the body and boost immunity</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="Herbal Remedies">Herbal Remedies</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="According to traditional Chinese medicine">According to traditional Chinese medicine</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame oil nourishes the kidneys">black sesame oil nourishes the kidneys</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="promotes digestion">promotes digestion</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="and improves circulation">and improves circulation</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="It can be used in medicinal dishes to support health">It can be used in medicinal dishes to support health</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="Black sesame oil has a wide range of uses in health care">Black sesame oil has a w